  "details": "Even though we just got a new menu revamp.... it feels \" Bloated / Fat \" vs the previous model. i go between Social lab and that Nav Icon to see whos in the world and then Scroll down or left. \nFirst::\nAbility to Pop the menu to the World and keep the Action menu on the hand where is should be.\n2nd::\nThe ability to do a Pop-up on Menus so that you may have multiple menus at once.\nExample:: \nView World Tab and Social Tab at once\n3rd::\nAbility to chose between Thumbnail or Text Only Format for those Tabs\n....Being able to select in Text Format....would reduce screen time lag when Loading them without the need to load pictures.\n4th::\nThe ability for World Creators to view Players in the Instance in a Simple List of players in the world with Stats of their avatars, pings, fps, course their names, etc....",
